---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | MyQRCodeFree"
  description="Privacy Policy for MyQRCodeFree. Learn how our browser-based, client-side QR code generator protects your privacy and personal data."
>
  <Header />
  <main class="flex-1 py-10 sm:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- Back Link -->
      <div class="mb-8">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors"
        >
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path>
          </svg>
          Back to Generator
        </a>
      </div>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 bg-white p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-xs dark:border-slate-800/80 dark:bg-slate-900/60">
        <header class="border-b border-slate-200/80 pb-6 dark:border-slate-800/80">
          <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-4xl">
            Privacy Policy
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
            Last Updated: September 2026
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="mt-8 space-y-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          <p>
            MyQRCodeFree (&ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;our,&rdquo; or &ldquo;us&rdquo;) operates myqrcodefree.com. This Privacy Policy explains how we handle information when you use our QR Code Generator.
          </p>

          <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              1. How Our Tool Works
            </h2>
            <p>
              All QR code generation happens entirely in your browser. When you enter a URL, text, WiFi credentials, contact details, or location coordinates, this information is processed locally on your device using JavaScript. None of this data is transmitted to, stored on, or accessible by our servers. We do not see, collect, or retain the content you enter into the QR generator.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              2. Information We Do Collect
            </h2>
            <p>
              While the QR generator itself is fully client-side, our website may use:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-6 marker:text-blue-500">
              <li>Cookies and similar technologies for basic site functionality</li>
              <li>Google AdSense, which may use cookies to serve personalized or non-personalized ads</li>
              <li>Google Analytics (if enabled), to understand aggregate site traffic and usage patterns</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              These third-party services may collect information such as your IP address, browser type, and browsing behavior, in accordance with their own privacy policies.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              3. Third-Party Advertising
            </h2>
            <p>
              We use Google AdSense to display ads. Google and its partners may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this or other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google's Ads Settings (<a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-medium text-blue-600 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-300">adssettings.google.com</a>).
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              4. Data Storage
            </h2>
            <p>
              Any preferences you set (such as color choices or dark mode) may be stored locally in your browser using localStorage. This data stays on your device and is never sent to us.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              5. Children's Privacy
            </h2>
            <p>
              Our service is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              6. Your Rights
            </h2>
            <p>
              Depending on your location, you may have rights to access, delete, or restrict processing of your data. Since we do not collect or store personal data on our servers, most such requests would apply to third-party services like Google — see their respective privacy policies for more.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              7. Changes to This Policy
            </h2>
            <p>
              We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              8. Contact Us
            </h2>
            <p>
              If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, contact us at: <a href="mailto:support@myqrcodefree.com" class="font-medium text-blue-600 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-300">support@myqrcodefree.com</a>
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
